          "stale_wake_ps": "2688000",
          "stale_wake_effect": "no_op",
          "zero_wake_ps": "3688000",
          "next_sof_ps": "3688000"
        }
      },
      "independent_calculation": "While this class sends, slope is 250000000-1000000000=-750000000 bit/s, producing -432 bits at EOF and -504 bits at release. Open non-sending recovery is 250000000 bit/s; 504 bits take 2016000 ps. In the gated case, recovery adds 82 bits before close (-422), freezes for 1000000 ps, then needs 1688000 ps after reopen."
